cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "tapered-sinc-dark-matter: A Unified Tapered-Sinc Halo Model"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
url: https://github.com/vasquezbrandon205/tapered-sinc-dark-matter
repository-code: https://github.com/vasquezbrandon205/tapered-sinc-dark-matter
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Vasquez
    given-names: Brandon Manuel
keywords:
  - dark-matter
  - rotation-curves
  - SPARC
  - halo-models
  - core-cusp-problem
abstract: >
  A unified dark-matter halo density profile combining a sinc-like
  finite core with a smooth taper to an NFW-like outer halo, with
  rotation-curve fitting, MCMC sampling, AIC/BIC model comparison,
  and positivity auditing.
